{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/4a0f5ce97b66f38dcfe1e3b5b1109aa5.poster.avif?t=1759322195\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/4a0f5ce97b66f38dcfe1e3b5b1109aa5.webm?t=1759322195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/4a0f5ce97b66f38dcfe1e3b5b1109aa5.mp4?t=1759322195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom has fallen to the Mad King, who has used forbidden magic to try resuscitate the queen. But the powers of life and death were too big to handle for him, and as a consequence, the King has lost his sanity. Slain hordes of enemies through careful button smashing! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/5ffdd03392639d39fa713b4c98c17c32.poster.avif?t=1759322195\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/5ffdd03392639d39fa713b4c98c17c32.webm?t=1759322195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/5ffdd03392639d39fa713b4c98c17c32.mp4?t=1759322195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful to a brawler, with the additional strategic layer of a roguelite, the destiny of the Kingdom lay upon your shoulders. Upgrade your brotherhood of heroes after each run to unlock combat skills, forbidden powers and heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/bafe10b7e8fcf21fa3c34332cc76c272.poster.avif?t=1759322195\" width=400 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/bafe10b7e8fcf21fa3c34332cc76c272.webm?t=1759322195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/bafe10b7e8fcf21fa3c34332cc76c272.mp4?t=1759322195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS DEMO VERSION INCLUDES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four playable heroes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A portion of the first biome : Baron Morgrim's dungeon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade system with dozens of combinations between passive and forbidden powers !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encountering the Mad King for the first time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FULL GAME WILL INCLUDE:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CO-OP mode and Mounts will be available in the full game (base version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While PlayStation controller work in the demo, the Full Dualshock / Dualsense support with in-game UI icons will come in the final version\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/6efa2bd93a9943dd25a1fe0871682071.poster.avif?t=1759322195\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046520/extras/6efa2bd93a9943dd25a1fe0871682071.webm?t=1759322195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/